questions.question_text:
A rescue blog uses this pictograph.
How many reptiles are shown?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large},scale=0.9]
\node at (3.6,3.2) {Animals rescued}; \node[right] at (0,2.1) {Birds}; \node[right] at (0,1.2) {Reptiles};
\foreach \x in {2.3,2.9,3.5,4.1,4.7,5.3} {\fill (\x,2.1) circle (4pt);}
\foreach \x in {2.3,2.9,3.5,4.1,4.7,5.3,5.9,6.5} {\fill (\x,1.2) circle (4pt);}
\fill (2.3,0.2) circle (4pt); \node[right] at (2.6,0.2) {$=3$ animals};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
